// The Windows Security event log being cleared.
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1070.001 Indicator Removal: Clear Windows Event Logs (Defense Evasion)
// Event 1102 = the audit log was cleared. Attackers clear logs to hide their
// tracks; legitimate admins and tools also do it, so every hit must be checked
// for authorisation.
SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 1102
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, Activity
